Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Add test for `SCOTCH_graphMapView()` and
 `SCOTCH_graphRemapView()`

Checks mapping statistics with known values on a path graph mapped
onto a line of processors, with base values 0 and 1: processor
counts, loads, neighbors, dilation, part diameters, migration
distance, preservation of part arrays, and partial mappings.
